# The backend image is built with the repository root as its context so that
# both backend/ and services/ are available. Send only what the image needs;
# secrets (.env, .aws), frontend, docs, and tests stay out of the context.
*
!backend/pyproject.toml
!backend/uv.lock
!backend/.python-version
!backend/app/
!services/
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
